---
// src/pages/refund.astro
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Refund Policy - TradeGuard Risk Enforcement</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 min-h-screen font-sans selection:bg-sky-500 selection:text-white">
    
    <!-- Navigation Bar -->
    <nav class="flex justify-between items-center p-6 border-b border-slate-800 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/" class="text-xl font-bold text-sky-400 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>🛡️</span> TradeGuard <span class="text-xs bg-sky-950 text-sky-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-sky-800">PRO</span>
      </a>
      <div class="flex space-x-6 text-sm">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">Home</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">Privacy Policy</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
      <div class="mb-12 border-b border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4">Refund Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Last Updated: November 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sky-400">1.</span> Free Trial First Policy
          </h2>
          <p>
            TradeGuard provides a <strong>3-Day Free Trial</strong> for all new users to evaluate our software utility, installation compatibility, and risk enforcement features on their Windows PC with zero financial risk. We strongly encourage all users to claim and test the 3-Day Free Trial prior to purchasing a paid pass (7-Day, 1-Month, or 1-Year Pass).
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sky-400">2.</span> Cryptocurrency Payments & Irreversibility
          </h2>
          <p>
            All paid passes on TradeGuard are processed via cryptocurrency payment gateways (e.g., NOWPayments). Due to the immutable and decentralized nature of blockchain transactions, cryptocurrency transfers cannot be automatically reversed once confirmed on-chain.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3 -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sky-400">3.</span> Eligible Refund Exceptions
          </h2>
          <p>
            We stand behind the technical functionality of TradeGuard. You may be eligible for a full or partial refund under the following verified conditions within <strong>7 days</strong> of purchase:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
            <li><strong>License Key Delivery Failure:</strong> Your cryptocurrency payment was confirmed on the blockchain, but our automated system failed to issue a license key, and our support team is unable to manually issue or deliver your key within 48 hours.</li>
            <li><strong>Duplicate Charges:</strong> You were accidentally charged multiple times for a single order transaction.</li>
            <li><strong>Unresolved Critical Technical Failure:</strong> TradeGuard fails to launch or operate on a supported Windows 10/11 system due to a verified software error, and our technical support team cannot resolve the issue or provide a fix within 5 business days of your ticket submission.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4 -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sky-400">4.</span> Non-Refundable Scenarios
          </h2>
          <div class="bg-slate-800/80 border-l-4 border-red-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-xs md:text-sm">
            <strong class="text-red-400 font-bold block">⚠️ Strict Non-Refundable Cases:</strong>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
              <li><strong>Active Risk Lockouts:</strong> Refunds will NOT be granted to bypass or terminate active trading lockouts triggered by your self-configured risk limits.</li>
              <li><strong>Change of Mind:</strong> Change of mind or lack of trading activity after activating your license key.</li>
              <li><strong>Trading Losses:</strong> Financial losses incurred while trading on any broker or platform.</li>
              <li><strong>Unsupported Environments:</strong> Incompatibility resulting from running unsupported operating systems (e.g., macOS, Linux, Windows 7/8).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5 -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sky-400">5.</span> How to Request a Refund
          </h2>
          <p>
            To request a refund, please send an email to <span class="text-sky-400 font-mono">support@gettradeguard.app</span> with the following details:
          </p>
          <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-300">
            <li>Your registered email address.</li>
            <li>Blockchain Transaction Hash (TxHash) or NOWPayments Order ID.</li>
            <li>A detailed description of the issue encountered (including screenshots or log files if applicable).</li>
          </ol>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 6 -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sky-400">6.</span> Refund Processing
          </h2>
          <p>
            Approved refunds will be processed in cryptocurrency (USDT or the original payment currency) to your designated wallet address. Please note that mandatory blockchain network transaction fees (Gas fees) will be deducted from the final refunded amount.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="py-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-500 border-t border-slate-800 space-y-3">
      <p>© 2026 TradeGuard Project. Dedicated risk enforcement for smart traders.</p>
      <p class="space-x-4">
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-sky-400 transition underline">Privacy Policy</a>
        <span>•</span>
        <a href="/terms" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-sky-400 transition underline">Terms of Service</a>
        <span>•</span>
        <a href="/refund" class="text-sky-400 transition underline">Refund Policy</a>
      </p>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>